      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "# IREN_MKZ \u2014 Fabric, CVT & Cabling\n\n**Three-plane fabric truth:** live host HCA telemetry, SIB/P2P switch inventory, and the exact scrape/validation coverage gaps. Dedicated UFM/Cumulus/CVT collectors are currently not publishing full telemetry; those targets are shown DOWN rather than rendered as healthy zeros.\n\n[Home](/d/iren_mkz-home?${__url_time_range}) \u00b7 [Command Center](/d/iren_mkz-command-center?${__url_time_range}) \u00b7 [Live Topology](/d/iren_mkz-topology?${__url_time_range}) \u00b7 [Infrastructure](/d/iren_mkz-infrastructure?${__url_time_range}) \u00b7 [GPU & NVLink](/d/iren_mkz-accelerators?${__url_time_range}) \u00b7 [Fabric, CVT & Cabling](/d/iren_mkz-fabric?${__url_time_range}) \u00b7 [Workloads, Slurm & Validation](/d/iren_mkz-workloads?${__url_time_range})",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "description": "Fabric decisions \u2014 live coverage and current faults: the summary and exact evidence for this decision layer.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 2,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Fabric decisions \u2014 live coverage and current faults",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Percentage of live host HCA ports in ACTIVE state (4). The exact non-ACTIVE ports are listed below.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 2,
          "links": [
            {
              "targetBlank": false,
              "title": "Open exact HCA worklist",
              "url": "/d/iren_mkz-fabric?${__url_time_range}"
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 98
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 99.5
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 100
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "100 * count(ib_hca_port_state{cluster=~\"$cluster\",datahall=~\"$datahall\",su=~\"$su\",rack=~\"$rack\",node=~\"$node\"} == 4) / count(ib_hca_port_state{cluster=~\"$cluster\",datahall=~\"$datahall\",su=~\"$su\",rack=~\"$rack\",node=~\"$node\"})",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "HCA ports ACTIVE",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Exact host HCA ports not in ACTIVE state. State values come from the live node-side HCA collector.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "links": [
            {
              "targetBlank": false,
              "title": "Open exact HCA worklist",
              "url": "/d/iren_mkz-fabric?${__url_time_range}"
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 6
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "count(ib_hca_port_state{cluster=~\"$cluster\",datahall=~\"$datahall\",su=~\"$su\",rack=~\"$rack\",node=~\"$node\"} != 4) or on() (count(ib_hca_port_state{cluster=~\"$cluster\",datahall=~\"$datahall\",su=~\"$su\",rack=~\"$rack\",node=~\"$node\"}) * 0)",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "HCA ports not ACTIVE",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Switch endpoints in the current live inventory roster: InfiniBand, Ethernet, and NVSwitch.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 6
      },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
